    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons, Darkness, and Stress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>Open the gate and step into a new area.<br>Beyond that, unknown dangers and rewards of exploration await.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/392937f6212dcff96c456aea9228eb48.poster.avif?t=1753258523\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/392937f6212dcff96c456aea9228eb48.webm?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/392937f6212dcff96c456aea9228eb48.mp4?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>The threats lurking throughout the dungeon will never let you down your guard.<br>Defeat your enemies in an overwhelming tension with authentic Souls-like combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/4af8a4a571b38ab02ccb5a704a440044.poster.avif?t=1753258523\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/4af8a4a571b38ab02ccb5a704a440044.webm?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/4af8a4a571b38ab02ccb5a704a440044.mp4?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>The dungeon is organically connected like a spider's web.<br>You will fall into a labyrinth amidst repeated deaths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/dce729cd56b1cd4f9a60db0dbb61e1a1.poster.avif?t=1753258523\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/dce729cd56b1cd4f9a60db0dbb61e1a1.webm?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/dce729cd56b1cd4f9a60db0dbb61e1a1.mp4?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dungeon exploration that seems to be swallowed by darkness<br></li><li>Cunning traps that eat away at your mind<br></li><li>Monsters that give you nightmares<br></li><li>Authentic souls-like style combat<br></li><li>Dark fantasy &amp; gothic worldview</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>Add it to your wishlist right now and prepare to be consumed by dark stress!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons, Darkness, and Stress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>Open the gate and step into a new area.<br>Beyond that, unknown dangers and rewards of exploration await.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/392937f6212dcff96c456aea9228eb48.poster.avif?t=1753258523\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/392937f6212dcff96c456aea9228eb48.webm?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/392937f6212dcff96c456aea9228eb48.mp4?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>The threats lurking throughout the dungeon will never let you down your guard.<br>Defeat your enemies in an overwhelming tension with authentic Souls-like combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/4af8a4a571b38ab02ccb5a704a440044.poster.avif?t=1753258523\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/4af8a4a571b38ab02ccb5a704a440044.webm?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/4af8a4a571b38ab02ccb5a704a440044.mp4?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>The dungeon is organically connected like a spider's web.<br>You will fall into a labyrinth amidst repeated deaths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/dce729cd56b1cd4f9a60db0dbb61e1a1.poster.avif?t=1753258523\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/dce729cd56b1cd4f9a60db0dbb61e1a1.webm?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045730/extras/dce729cd56b1cd4f9a60db0dbb61e1a1.mp4?t=1753258523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dungeon exploration that seems to be swallowed by darkness<br></li><li>Cunning traps that eat away at your mind<br></li><li>Monsters that give you nightmares<br></li><li>Authentic souls-like style combat<br></li><li>Dark fantasy &amp; gothic worldview</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>Add it to your wishlist right now and prepare to be consumed by dark stress!",
